---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BlogPostLayout from '../../components/BlogPostLayout.astro';
import { availableItems, displayName, displayDescription, deliverySlabLine } from '../../lib/data';
import { abs, blogPostingJsonLd, breadcrumbJsonLd, itemUrl } from '../../lib/seo';
const headline = 'Pizza Under ₹300 in Sundargarh | The Oven Vibe';
const description = 'Current pure veg pizza options under ₹300 from our direct menu, with actual sizes, prices and the charges to check before ordering.';
const path = '/blog/pizza-under-300/';
const image = {url:abs('/static/images/og/blog_4.jpg'),width:1200,height:630,alt:'The Oven Vibe food photograph'};
const pizzas=availableItems.filter(i=>['Classic Favorite Pizza','Signature Pizza'].includes(i.category) && i.price<300).sort((a,b)=>a.price-b.price);
---
<Layout title={headline} description={description} ogType="article" image={image} jsonLd={[blogPostingJsonLd({headline,description,path,image:image.url,datePublished:'2024-05-30',dateModified:'2026-10-17'}),breadcrumbJsonLd([{name:'Blog',path:'/blog/'},{name:headline,path}])]}>
 <BlogPostLayout line1='PIZZA UNDER' lineGradient='₹300.' subtitle='The current choices, with sizes and the final bill in mind.'>
  <picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="/static/images/blog_images/blog_4.avif"/><source type="image/webp" srcset="/static/images/blog_images/blog_4.webp"/><img src="/static/images/blog_images/blog_4.webp" alt="The Oven Vibe food photograph" class="blog-img" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="1024"/></picture>

  <p>If ₹300 is your food budget, start with the actual pizza price and size, then check delivery separately. The list below is drawn from our direct-order catalogue; it is not a promise about app prices or the final delivered total.</p>
  <h2>What is currently below ₹300?</h2>
  <p>There are {pizzas.length} available regular Classic Favorite and Signature pizzas below ₹300 in this catalogue. Seasonal specials are listed separately on the full menu.</p>
  {pizzas.length ? <ul>{pizzas.map(p=><li><a href={itemUrl(p.product_code)}><strong>{displayName(p.display_name)}</strong></a> — ₹{p.price}. {displayDescription(p)}</li>)}</ul> : <p>No regular pizza is currently below this budget. Check the full menu for alternatives instead of relying on an old price claim.</p>}
  <h2>Do not compare price without size</h2>
  <p>Regular Classic Favorite pizzas are listed as 7-inch; regular Signature pizzas describe an 8-inch pizza cut into four slices. Different toppings and sauces also affect the choice. The category name is not a portion guarantee for a separate seasonal item.</p>
  <h2>Keep the delivered total within your budget</h2>
  <ol><li>Pick the exact pizza and any extras.</li><li>Choose pickup or delivery and the correct time in the <a href="/price-calculator/">calculator</a>.</li><li>Read the final total. Standard direct delivery is {deliverySlabLine.toLowerCase()}; late-night and applicable rain charges are separate.</li><li>Confirm the order with the kitchen before paying or travelling to collect it.</li></ol>
  <h2>When is a combo useful?</h2><p>Only when you want the included side and drink. Match their sizes and quantities before comparing a combo with separate items. Adding unwanted food to reach a free-delivery threshold can increase your spending overall.</p>

  <p><a href="/choose/">Compare ingredients, serving sizes and combos</a>, <a href="/menu/">browse the full menu</a>, or <a href="/faq/">read the ordering answers</a>.</p>
 </BlogPostLayout>
</Layout>
